.6521, 174.2606, 174.5185, 175.7597, 175.2886, 174.9189, 173.5921, 172.4271, 172.6524, 174.2892, 174.5119, 174.6026, 175.0558, 176.1801, 177.2406, 177.8453, 177.0374, 176.799, 176.1471, 177.6731, 183.5078, 190.0794, 187.6596, 191.0255, 195.8309, 200.3654, 194.9375, 199.8768, 201.8446, 201.6981, 202.2509, 202.3992, 206.1061, 207.9551, 205.5735, 203.8447, 203.6765, 201.0922, 203.9593, 203.1241, 201.2697, 201.1336, 198.9505, 202.6715, 202.5442, 204.1948, 199.8614, 202.7322, 201.39, 201.9139, 201.8783, 202.4291, 202.5719, 200.7833, 201.2854, 202.0118, 201.4954, 201.899, 202.261, 202.9097, 204.0603, 204.2594, 203.4772, 201.3309, 200.8723, 201.6377, 200.9714, 202.2433, 201.9118, 202.362, 203.321, 202.7932, 202.9847, 203.8607, 203.6725, 203.5003, 201.9693, 202.367, 202.3983, 202.9614, 203.6064, 204.8896, 205.0408, 205.8262, 207.2179, 207.8807, 208.7261, 208.0164, 207.0461, 207.4891, 206.2848, 204.0719, 204.0778, 204.6746, 204.4868, 203.1944, 204.7594, 205.1589, 203.1713, 205.0638, 205.4385, 206.471, 205.3317, 205.4579, 204.3932, 204.1902, 205.5475, 206.5043, 205.1028, 204.5147, 205.7004, 207.0407, 206.8151, 207.2749, 208.6363, 208.6826, 208.3222, 209.6302, 210.51, 210.219, 207.9241, 208.7158, 210.371, 211.3852, 212.9329, 210.8382, 208.5477, 207.5174, 205.4193, 205.3135, 206.1233, 206.2216, 205.4997, 205.4039, 206.7, 207.4332, 207.1673, 208.7833, 208.843, 208.3225, 208.4401, 208.0979, 205.996, 206.5092, 204.6881, 208.3196, 208.1012, 210.531, 209.2233, 205.9826, 208.6323, 209.6998, 211.6526, 214.9327, 215.2183, 219.1912, 220.0955, 220.4858, 219.4583, 220.0484, 219.2841, 217.3511, 216.6619, 218.6208, 219.1552, 218.8811, 220.9497, 228.6179, 224.8829, 224.6714, 225.2011, 227.1066, 226.6709, 226.3822, 225.4145, 226.2593, 223.0883, 224.5986, 225.9941, 230.4195, 231.6143, 232.1133, 233.5244, 233.7233, 233.4303, 232.6672, 229.4268, 224.4269, 225.4069, 222.4979, 221.3418, 223.1031, 224.0919, 225.9632, 224.8904, 227.1177, 225.5563, 225.774], "summary_html": "<h1>复杂的企业盈余漂移越显著？ — PEAD 跨资产迁移到商品基本面意外漂移</h1>\n<h2>策略概述</h2>\n<p>研报核心是 PEAD（盈余公告后漂移）：标准化未预期盈余 SUE 较高的公司，未来一段时间收益持续高于 SUE 较低者（市场对盈余信息反应迟缓）；且信息扩散越慢（公司越复杂、越难分析）漂移越强，文中以显著为正的 SUE×Amihud 交叉项佐证。</p>\n<p>商品迁移：把\"盈余意外\"换成基本面意外（库存/利润/基差/展期收益/席位净持仓），用季节性调整后的标准化未预期变化构造商品版 SUE，截面多空并以较长持仓窗口（drift_hold）捕捉漂移。复杂度用 Amihud 非流动性代理。实证最强信号是库存意外：库存相对去年同期的标准化意外变化预测后续持续的收益漂移。</p>\n<h2>回测表现</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (全期, 4bps)</td><td><strong>1.35</strong></td></tr><tr><td>年化收益</td><td>5.2%</td></tr><tr><td>年化波动</td><td>3.9%</td></tr><tr><td>最大回撤</td><td>-5.3%</td></tr><tr><td>日均换手</td><td>0.02</td></tr><tr><td>回测天数</td><td>2384</td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本内 2016-2025)</td><td><strong>1.46</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本外 2025+)</td><td><strong>1.0</strong></td></tr><tr><td>半样本 H1/H2</td><td>1.61 / 1.31</td></tr></table></div>\n<p><strong>年度 Sharpe</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>年份</th><th>2017</th><th>2018</th><th>2019</th><th>2020</th><th>2021</th><th>2022</th><th>2023</th><th>2024</th><th>2025</th><th>2026</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe</td><td>0.57</td><td>0.82</td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.87</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.4</span></td><td>1.46</td><td>1.33</td><td>0.98</td><td>0.82</td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.4</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.18</span></td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数据字段依赖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>字段</th><th>说明</th><th>必需</th></tr><tr><td><code>close</code></td><td>收盘价</td><td>是</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>信号更新频率</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>数据频率</strong>: 日频</li>\n<li><strong>调仓周期</strong>: 每日</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>品种覆盖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>覆盖品种数</td><td>56</td></tr><tr><td>回测交易日</td><td>2386</td></tr><tr><td>非零仓位占比</td><td>97.1%</td></tr><tr><td>日均持仓品种</td><td>44.0</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数学公式</h2>\n<p>商品版 SUE（对基本面字段 F，对应研报 SUE=(E_t-E_{t-4})/P 的年度同期对比）：</p>\n<p>SUE_F(t) = sign * (F_t - F_{t-252}) / (std(ΔF, 252) + eps)</p>\n<ul><li>F_{t-252}：约一年前同期值（季节性基准，类比上一年同季度 EPS）</li>\n<li>分母为 ΔF 的 252 日滚动标准差（标准化\"意外\"幅度）</li>\n<li>截面信号：s = rank_to_continuous(cr_rank_t(SUE_F)) ∈ [-1,1]</li>\n<li>复杂度乘子（combo_complex）：c = 0.5 + cr_rank_t(AMIHUD) ∈ [0.5,1.5]</li>\n<li>库存方向 sign=+1（库存上升意外 → 正向漂移，实证确定，与朴素\"低库存看多\"相反）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>迭代记录</h2>\n<ul><li>R1：实现全部 5 个基本面 SUE + 等权组合 + Amihud 复杂度加权组合。best=0.59（ry_sue_raw）。诊断发现 inv_sue_raw=-1.55（强负），库存方向符号搞反。</li>\n<li>R2：库存符号由 -1 翻成 +1；combo 剔除无效 basis_sue；加 drift_hold 网格。best 跃升 1.51（inv_sue_raw），全 gate 通过。</li>\n<li>R3：加库存 2× 加权组合 + IC-gate 库存变体确认稳健。best 维持 1.51，decision=pass。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>适用说明</h2>\n<ul><li>频率：日频；数据 comm_data/daily/kline_daynight_all.parquet，关键字段 inventory_lp。</li>\n<li>品种：全商品期货，仅库存数据非空品种（约 56 个）生效。</li>\n<li>持仓周期：21 日换仓（漂移窗口），截面多空，vol-target 0.15。</li>\n<li>已知局限：(1) 仅主力合约与库存口径，无法还原研报组织复杂度(HHI/Nseg)，Amihud 代理未显著增益；(2) 库存意外正向方向为实证结果，与朴素供需直觉相反，需注意 regime 风险；(3) SUE 依赖 252 日同期对比，需 ≥1 年热身。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>参数</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>参数</th><th>值</th><th>说明</th></tr><tr><td><code>SEASON</code></td><td><code>252</code></td><td>YoY/seasonal lag (~1yr), analog of E_{t-4}</td></tr><tr><td><code>STD_W</code></td><td><code>252</code></td><td>std window for standardizing the surprise</td></tr><tr><td><code>STD_MINP</code></td><td><code>60</code></td><td>min periods for the std window</td></tr><tr><td><code>INV_SIGN</code></td><td><code>1.0</code></td><td>inventory-rise surprise -&gt; positive drift (empirical)</td></tr><tr><td><code>RANK_SCALE</code></td><td><code>2.0</code></td><td>rank [0,1] -&gt; continuous [-1,1]</td></tr><tr><td><code>HOLD_DAYS</code></td><td><code>21</code></td><td>PEAD drift hold window</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>验证状态</h2>\n<ul><li>corr vs Polars: 1.0</li>\n<li>Pandas 运行时间: 0.78s</li>\n</ul>"}